OL,3,GNEWSAMan admits killing woman in crash
OL,4,
OL,5,FA man has admitted causing the death of
OL,6,Fa woman following a crash on the A15
OL,7,Fnear Sleaford.
OL,9,FThe incident, involving two cars and a
OL,10,Fvan, happened at Leasingham on 11
OL,11,FJanuary 2024.
OL,13,FHannah Curtis, 22, from Lincoln, died
OL,14,F16 days later in hospital and three
OL,15,Fothers, including a young child, were
OL,16,Finjured.
OL,18,FOn Thursday, Calum Drake, 22, of
OL,19,FStratton Strawless, Norfolk, appeared
OL,20,Fat Lincoln Crown Court, where he
OL,21,Fpleaded guilty to causing death by
OL,22,Fcareless driving.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
